        "name": "USN-6905-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that Rack incorrectly handled certain regular  expressions. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause  Rack to consume resources, leading to a denial of service. (CVE-2023-27539)  It was discovered that Rack incorrectly handled Multipart MIME parsing. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause Rack to consume resources, leading to a denial of service. This issue only affected  Ubuntu 20.04 LTS and Ubuntu 22.04 LTS. (CVE-2023-27530)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2023-27530",
          "CVE-2023-27539"
        ]
      },
